          </div>`).join('')}
      </div>
    </div>`).join('');
  el.innerHTML=`
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem">
      <div><strong>${total} questions</strong> across ${themes.length} themes${when?` <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.8rem">· generated ${when}</span>`:''}</div>
